    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following features:</p><p><strong>Invisible Alarm:</strong> You can spend 10 minutes creating an invisible trip wire that encompasses 10 connected squares. You can designate any number of creatures who won't trigger the trip wire. If a non-designated creature enters a square where the trip wire is, you are mentally alerted as long as you are within one mile of it. You can choose to have a loud ringing bell sound to emanate from the area.</p><p>The trip wire lasts for 24 hours, until it's triggered, or you use this feature again.</p><p><strong>Arcane Ward:</strong> You gain the following maneuver.</p>",
